<title>UK: CSFB sets call warrants on Shiseido.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call warrants on Shiseido.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued one million American-style call warrants on shares of Shiseido Co Ltd.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,920 YEN		 PREMIUM	14.30 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     35.0 CHF		  GEARING	7.0 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 31.JUL.97-16.MAR.99   PAYDATE	30.JUL.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,920 YEN (FOREX FIX 78,34 YEN/CHF)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
